07:40:34.522 | Pathway through barren isthmus. (road)
07:40:34.528 | A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. Many of the stars are disguised behind looming clouds, tracing their slow paths across the sphere of the heavens. Weeds in hues of emerald, teal, and blood-red adorn the glistening rocks of this otherwise dreary landscape. Snails cling to the vegetation, scattered among the wet leaves like spilled jewels, their ivory and gold shells shimmering in the light. Hollow spaces in the stone form large, shining pools filled with small blue crabs, spiky purple sea urchins, and even a few tiny starfish. Periodically, a loud crash disrupts the peaceful scene as a vast wave washes violently over the strip of land, forcing the crabs to scramble for shelter to avoid being swept away. Moments later the water recedes, and the creatures resume their activity. A decaying corpse has been impaled here upon a fifteen foot stake. An occupied iron gibbet, suspended from a wooden gallows, creaks ominously in the breeze. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. Warden Sinit d'Ivoire is here. The Golden Dragon Aegoth's imposing form looms. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is here. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right.
